{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53450","headline":"驻锡峯 · 邢允中","name":"驻锡峯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高峯常驻锡，灵异见当年。\n卓立惊沙界，光辉动梵天。\n鹤飞青霭外，龙护赤岚边。\n丈室仍相对，重来果夙缘。\n（见董庆酉《四明诗干》卷中。\n邢允中诗承张靖龙同志录示）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邢允中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}